emetry-instrumentation-annotations.enabled=false\n```\n\n- **Compatibility:** Version-specific selectors take precedence over versionless selectors. Replace `otel.instrumentation.annotations.enabled` with `otel.instrumentation.opentelemetry-instrumentation-annotations.enabled`, and versioned `opentelemetry-api-incubator-<version>` selectors with `opentelemetry-api-incubator`. Migration guidance is in `CHANGELOG.md`.\n- **Coverage:** Add shared enablement regression cases and agent-backed enabled/disabled coverage. Update existing incubator test selectors while retaining separate stable, incubator, and dependency-version suites.\n- **Scope:** Related work for #20510, limited to API bridges and instrumentation annotations. Leave the `@Counted` work in #19379, span-conversion changes in #20442, and shared preview infrastructure untouched.","title":"Adopt 3.0 enablement for API bridges and instrumentation annotations"},"mode":"publish","pr":20538,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1791822979,"generation":1,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"5e5c209f1de8422c8824e07ed219f352","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":["Analyze (actions)","Analyze Java (none)","Analyze Kotlin (manual)","CodeQL","EasyCLA","build / build-servlet-images","build / common / build","build / common / check-gh-aw-lockfiles","build / common / examples","build / common / fossa-configuration-check","build / common / gradle-plugins","build / common / license-check","build / common / repo-checks","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, jetty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, liberty)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, other)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, payara)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, spring-aot)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomcat)","build / common / smoke-test (ubuntu-latest, tomee)","build / common / smoke-tes